        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Leslie Phillips, Ray Galton, Alan Simpson, Bryan Brown\n- Works: Some Will, Some Won't, Get Well Soon, Tombstone, Carry On Columbus\n- Roles: Henry Russell, Lucky, Grandfather\n\nFacts:\n- Leslie Phillips played Henry Russell in the film \"Some Will, Some Won't.\"\n- The TV series \"Get Well Soon\" depicted the real-life meeting of writers Ray Galton and Alan Simpson.\n- Ray Galton and Alan Simpson wrote the film \"Tombstone.\"\n- Leslie Phillips starred in the film \"Tombstone.\"\n- Leslie Phillips also played Bryan Brown's grandfather in \"Carry On Columbus.\"",
